{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZNS3GVVnPz1793693702.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>第五屆國際金融領袖投資峰會，主峰會早上開幕，約280名全球企業高管及內地部門高層官員雲集。行政長官李家超、財政司司長陳茂波、金管局總裁余偉文、外交部駐港特派員崔建春等出席。國務院副總理何立峰視像演講指，中央對香港落實五年規劃充滿信心，期望加快北部都會區建設。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204327-%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E5%B3%B0%E6%9C%83%E4%BD%95%E7%AB%8B%E5%B3%B0%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%B0%8D%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%90%BD%E5%AF%A6%E4%BA%94%E5%B9%B4%E8%A6%8F%E5%8A%83%E5%85%85%E6%BB%BF%E4%BF%A1%E5%BF%83%E5%86%80%E5%8A%A0%E5%BF%AB%E5%8C%97%E9%83%BD%E5%BB%BA%E8%A8%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>金融峰會｜何立峰︰中央對香港落實五年規劃充滿信心　冀加快北都建設</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204325-%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E5%B3%B0%E6%9C%83%E4%BD%95%E7%AB%8B%E5%B3%B0%E4%B8%BB%E9%A1%8C%E6%BC%94%E8%AC%9B%E6%89%BF%E6%8E%A5%E4%BA%94%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%83%E5%85%AC%E5%91%8A%E5%95%9F%E7%A4%BA%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E6%9C%AA%E4%BE%86%E8%AC%80%E5%8A%83%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>金融峰會｜何立峰主題演講承接五中全會公告　啟示香港未來謀劃｜延伸閱讀</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204361-%E9%87%91%E8%9E%8D%E5%B3%B0%E6%9C%83%E5%A4%9A%E5%80%8B%E5%85%A7%E5%9C%B0%E8%B2%A1%E9%87%91%E9%83%A8%E9%96%80%E4%BB%A3%E8%A1%A8%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%ADAI%E8%9E%8D%E8%B3%87%E6%86%82%E6%85%AE%E6%88%90%E7%84%A6%E9%BB%9E%E4%B9%8B%E4%B8%80\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>金融峰會｜多個內地財金部門代表出席　AI融資憂慮成焦點之一</strong></a></p><p></p><p>行政長官李家超前往北京和上海訪問。他明天出席京港洽談會開幕式和致辭，之後會轉往上海，出席周四舉行的第九屆進博會暨虹橋國際經濟論壇開幕式，並於香港分論壇致辭。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204330-%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E5%95%9F%E7%A8%8B%E8%A8%AA%E4%BA%AC%E6%BB%AC%E5%91%A8%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%87%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%AD%E4%BA%AC%E6%B8%AF%E6%B4%BD%E8%AB%87%E6%9C%83%E9%96%8B%E5%B9%95%E5%BC%8F%E5%8F%8A%E8%87%B4%E8%BE%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>李家超啟程訪京滬　周三將出席京港洽談會開幕式及致辭</strong></a></p><p></p><p>運輸署咪表泊車系統早上一度發生故障，歷時近4小時。運輸及物流局局長陳美寶稱，已指示營運商24小時內提交報告。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204346-%E5%92%AA%E8%A1%A8%E6%B3%8A%E8%BB%8A%E7%B3%BB%E7%B5%B1%E4%B8%80%E5%BA%A6%E6%95%85%E9%9A%9C%E8%BF%914%E5%B0%8F%E6%99%82%E9%99%B3%E7%BE%8E%E5%AF%B6%E6%8C%87%E7%A4%BA%E7%87%9F%E9%81%8B%E5%95%8624%E5%B0%8F%E6%99%82%E5%85%A7%E6%8F%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>咪表泊車系統一度故障近4小時　陳美寶︰指示營運商24小時內提交報告</strong></a></p><p></p><p>政府就修訂《建築物管理條例》，向立法會交代建議修訂方案，包括就大型維修工程採購引入親自投票門檻分級制。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204347-%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E4%BF%AE%E8%A8%82%E5%BB%BA%E7%AF%89%E7%89%A9%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E6%A2%9D%E4%BE%8B%E5%A4%A7%E5%9E%8B%E7%B6%AD%E4%BF%AE%E6%8E%A1%E8%B3%BC%E5%BC%95%E5%85%A5%E8%A6%AA%E8%87%AA%E6%8A%95%E7%A5%A8%E9%96%80%E6%AA%BB%E5%88%86%E7%B4%9A%E5%88%B6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>政府修訂《建築物管理條例》　大型維修採購引入親自投票門檻分級制</strong></a></p><p></p><p>元朗區議員施駿興與女童非法性交罪成，在區域法院被判監兩年半。政府指，其區議員酬津自9月14日定罪起已停止發放。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1204308-%E5%85%83%E6%9C%97%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E6%96%BD%E9%A7%BF%E8%88%88%E9%9D%9E%E6%B3%95%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%A4%E7%BD%AA%E6%88%90%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%8C%87%E5%85%B6%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%B0%E5%93%A1%E9%85%AC%E6%B4%A5%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E7%BD%AA%E8%B5%B7%E5%B7%B2%E5%81%9C%E6%AD%A2%E7%99%BC%E6%94%BE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>元朗區議員施駿興非法性交罪成　政府指其區議員酬津自定罪起已停止發放</strong></a></p><p></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:21.837000+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":619,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T04:38:24.411653+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T09:19:50.004517+00:00","content_hash":"762f42445af0d3bfa56de0300e9efb9ec9410635dcce5e358524a609171cc7eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T09:24:21.837000+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}